2. **Construct the tridiagonal matrix \( A \)**:
   - For the operator \( \frac{d^2}{dx^2} - 1 \):
     \[
     A = \frac{1}{h^2} \begin{pmatrix}
     2 - h^2 & -1 & 0 & \cdots & 0 \\
     -1 & 2 - h^2 & -1 & \cdots & 0 \\
     0 & -1 & 2 - h^2 & \ddots & 0 \\
     \vdots & \vdots & \ddots & \ddots & -1 \\
     0 & 0 & \cdots & -1 & 2 - h^2
     \end{pmatrix}
     \]
   - With \( h = 0.1 \):
     \[
